meta {
  name: 08-contract
  seq: 9
}

docs {
  Cross-cutting HTTP behavior that belongs to no single domain: the error
  envelope, request-id propagation, CORS, the docs surface, and 404/405
  handling.

  This is the folder with the least overlap with pytest. The in-process test
  suite exercises handlers; these assertions cover what only a real server
  reaching a real client can show — middleware ordering, headers that survive
  the whole stack, and the exact bytes on the wire.
}
